    upstream has never carried it. Found by the derivation on 2026-08-24, not by
    the record: it had never been audited, and the record said so only by
    omitting it from `audited-paths`.
  documentation.md:3 — the build-and-configuration-file clause. Not an upstream
    omission: no revision of the template's scope line has ever carried it. #454
    added it here for #388 (a Dockerfile citing ADR 0018 against a log ending at
    0017) and #390. b4872ad's removal is not adopted.
  documentation.md — the mockery mandate, removed by #623 ruling 6 from four
